# AddressSanitizer suppressions for scripts/sanitize_upgrade.sh.
#
# ASan can suppress only reports raised inside an interceptor (interceptor_via_fun:, interceptor_via_lib:) and
# ODR violations (odr_violation:); a heap or stack error in instrumented code cannot be suppressed and is a
# finding.  Only reports traced to third-party code (Minuit2, GSL, the OpenMP runtime) may be listed here, each
# with its reason above it.
